{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-07-20 06:20:00', 'title': 'LINDE SIGNS AGREEMENT TO SUPPLY HIGH-PURITY INDUSTRIAL GASES TO PT FREEPORT INDONESIA', 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JULY 20, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A LONG-TERM AGREEMENT TO SUPPLY HIGH-PURITY INDUSTRIAL GASES TO PT FREEPORT INDONESIA, A LEADING MINING COMPANY IN INDONESIA. LINDE WILL BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE AN AIR SEPARATION UNIT (ASU) TO SUPPLY OXYGEN AND NITROGEN TO PT FREEPORT INDONESIA'S NEW COPPER SMELTER AND REFINERY IN MANYAR, INDONESIA."}